BINDING BOUNDARY POLICY (repeat to any sub-worker):
- audit_repo_root = /config/workspace/IronClaude/.dev/worktrees/ci-followup/.dev/research/upstream-merge-impact/remaining-cleanup-validation/implementation-evidence/02-root-plugin/task4-runtime-cwd-fix1/fixtures/project
- allowed evidence roots: audit_repo_root, plus this run's own evidence under the output root (read-only): <OUT>/artifacts/coverage-matrix.yaml, <OUT>/artifacts/reuse-audit.yaml, <OUT>/grounding-gaps.yaml
- output root <OUT> (orchestrator writes only): /config/workspace/IronClaude/.dev/worktrees/ci-followup/.dev/research/upstream-merge-impact/remaining-cleanup-validation/implementation-evidence/02-root-plugin/task4-runtime-cwd-fix1/runs/post-default-attempt-1/artifacts
- plugin resource root: /config/workspace/IronClaude/.dev/worktrees/ci-followup/.dev/research/upstream-merge-impact/remaining-cleanup-validation/implementation-evidence/02-root-plugin/task4-runtime-cwd-fix1/plugin  (taxonomy: plugin/skills/sc-reflect-protocol/refs/deviation-taxonomy.md)
- Exact permitted cwd paths: launch_cwd=/tmp/ironclaude-reflect-runtime-_rz3x5yo and audit_repo_root. No cd/pushd/popd; absolute paths only; never enter the output/plugin dirs as cwd. Do not read any ancestor pyproject.toml, CLAUDE.md, package or project mirrors. Do not execute tests or any writing command. No MCP tools; use Read/Grep/Glob.

INPUTS (under audit_repo_root): spec.md (R-001..R-003), completed.md (T-101..T-103, frontmatter status: done), changes.patch (diff FILE, evidence only), scope src/. Also on disk: src/greeting.py, tests/test_greeting.py (untracked, outside scope, NOT in changes.patch). The repo has git init only, no commits.

TASK: Independently Read the inputs and the run evidence, then produce a grounded reflection card:
- per-requirement and per-task verdict (R-001/T-101, R-002/T-102, R-003/T-103) with file:line citations you personally Read;
- deviation register: every divergence classified as exactly one of authorized | necessary | drift | regression per the taxonomy (precedence Regression > Drift > Necessary > Authorized), or "none" — with one-line rationale. Insufficient-evidence items go to grounding_gaps, NOT the register (an existing gap: tests were never executed — confirm or refine it);
- regression_candidates (list, may be empty) with reasoning;
- risk register: blast radius, untested invariants (e.g., `not name` truthiness semantics, whitespace names, non-str inputs), diff-completeness (T-103 test file missing from changes.patch);
- recommendations: each names file, change, verifier, priority;
- self_reported_confidence (0-1; the orchestrator will discard it in favour of blind calibration).
Tag any uncited claim [INFERRED]. Be adversarial: look for anything that would make this NOT a clean pass.

input.command:
O=/config/workspace/IronClaude/.dev/worktrees/ci-followup/.dev/research/upstream-merge-impact/remaining-cleanup-validation/implementation-evidence/02-root-plugin/task4-runtime-cwd-fix1/runs/post-default-attempt-1/artifacts
cat > $O/artifacts/reflection-card.yaml <<'EOF'
# Tier-1 reflection card. Author: sc:sc-root-cause-analyst (requested model slot: sonnet). Persisted verbatim-in-substance by orchestrator.
# Citations are relative to audit_repo_root = .../fixtures/project unless prefixed <OUT>.
reflection_card:
  mode: post
  tier: 1
  requirement_verdicts:
    - {id: R-001, task: T-101, verdict: satisfied, citations: ["spec.md:5-6", "src/greeting.py:4", "tests/test_greeting.py:4-5", "changes.patch:9", "completed.md:6"], note: "f-string yields exactly 'Hello, Ada!' for 'Ada' (static read; not executed)"}
    - {id: R-002, task: T-102, verdict: satisfied, citations: ["spec.md:8-9", "src/greeting.py:2-3", "tests/test_greeting.py:8-13", "changes.patch:7-8", "completed.md:7"], note: "greet('') raises ValueError; `not name` also rejects None/0/[] - superset, no criterion contradicted"}
    - {id: R-003, task: T-103, verdict: satisfied_on_disk_not_in_diff, citations: ["spec.md:11-12", "tests/test_greeting.py:4-5", "tests/test_greeting.py:8-13", "completed.md:8", "execution.log:4"], note: "both cases exist on disk; file absent from changes.patch (lines 1-9 cover only src/greeting.py), untracked, outside --scope; pass status unproven"}
  task_verdicts:
    - {task: T-101, status_claimed: done, verdict: verified_static, cite: "completed.md:6; src/greeting.py:1-4"}
    - {task: T-102, status_claimed: done, verdict: verified_static, cite: "completed.md:7; src/greeting.py:2-3"}
    - {task: T-103, status_claimed: done, verdict: verified_static_on_disk_only, cite: "completed.md:8; tests/test_greeting.py:1-13"}
    - {frontmatter: "completed.md:2 status: done - not contradicted by static evidence"}
  deviation_register: []
  deviation_register_rationale: "Single hunk changes.patch:5-9 maps to T-101/T-102; src/greeting.py:1-4 equals the diff; no unmapped hunk (no Drift); no criterion contradicted spec.md:5-12 vs src/greeting.py:2-4 (no Regression); no rationale-bearing divergence (no Necessary); no scope expansion (no Authorized). Test file missing from diff is a diff-completeness flag, not a deviation."
  regression_candidates:
    - {candidate: "`if not name` truthiness (src/greeting.py:2)", assessed: not_a_regression, reasoning: "contradicts no criterion (spec.md:9); new file (changes.patch:2-3) so no previously-passing test"}
    - {candidate: "test import `from src.greeting import greet` (tests/test_greeting.py:1)", assessed: possible_collection_failure_unproven, reasoning: "[INFERRED] no conftest/__init__/pyproject in fixture; bare `pytest` under prepend import mode may fail to import `src`; pytest exit 2 maps to Grounding Gap, not Regression"}
  grounding_gaps:
    - {ref: "src/greeting.py:1-4; tests/test_greeting.py:1-13", status: confirmed_and_refined, confirmation: "<OUT>/grounding-gaps.yaml:1-7 holds; execution.log:5 'No test execution is claimed'", refinement: "[INFERRED] verify with `python -m pytest` (rootdir on sys.path); plain pytest may hit collection error"}
  risk_register:
    - {id: RK-1, kind: untested_execution, detail: "tests never run (execution.log:5; <OUT>/grounding-gaps.yaml:2)"}
    - {id: RK-2, kind: truthiness_semantics, detail: "`not name` (src/greeting.py:2) rejects falsy non-str with ValueError; truthy non-str accepted (greet(5) -> 'Hello, 5!'); untested (tests/test_greeting.py:4-13 covers only 'Ada' and '')"}
    - {id: RK-3, kind: whitespace_names, detail: "greet('   ') returns 'Hello,    !'; whether whitespace counts as empty is ambiguous in spec.md:9; untested"}
    - {id: RK-4, kind: diff_completeness, detail: "T-103 deliverable not in changes.patch:1-9; diff-only completion would be 0.667 vs disk-verified 1.0 (<OUT>/artifacts/coverage-matrix.yaml:14); no commits so provenance unprovable"}
    - {id: RK-5, kind: test_weakness, detail: "test_empty (tests/test_greeting.py:8-13) does not assert the message"}
    - {id: RK-6, kind: audit_tooling_degradation, detail: "auggie unavailable (<OUT>/artifacts/reuse-audit.yaml:6); verification triangle unavailable"}
  recommendations:
    - {id: R-1, priority: P1, file: tests/test_greeting.py, change: "run `python -m pytest tests/test_greeting.py -q -p no:cacheprovider` from fixture root", verifier: "exit 0 (1=failed test, 2=collection error)"}
    - {id: R-2, priority: P2, file: changes.patch, change: "regenerate patch including tests/test_greeting.py (e.g. `git add -N tests && git diff`) or document tests as out of diff scope", verifier: "hunk for tests/test_greeting.py present and mapped to T-103"}
    - {id: R-3, priority: P2, file: "tests/test_greeting.py (or conftest.py/pyproject.toml)", change: "make `src` import robust (conftest.py, pythonpath setting, or __init__.py)", verifier: "plain `pytest` collects without ModuleNotFoundError"}
    - {id: R-4, priority: P3, file: spec.md, change: "state whether whitespace-only and non-str names must be rejected and with which exception", verifier: "spec updated; tests for '   ', None, 0 added"}
    - {id: R-5, priority: P3, file: src/greeting.py, change: "after spec decision, tighten guard (e.g. isinstance(name, str) and name.strip())", verifier: "new RK-2/RK-3 tests pass"}
  overall_assessment: "Static evidence meets R-001..R-003, empty deviation register, no confirmed regression; not a fully clean grounded pass - test execution unproven and T-103 deliverable absent from the diff."
  self_reported_confidence: 0.72   # discarded; blind calibration authoritative
EOF
echo "{\"wave\":1,\"step\":\"1C\",\"outcome\":\"ok\",\"evidence_ref\":\"$O/artifacts/reflection-card.yaml\",\"agent\":\"sc:sc-root-cause-analyst\",\"requested_model_slot\":\"sonnet\",\"returned_provider_model\":\"not surfaced by Agent tool; slot alias sonnet -> claude-sonnet-5-5[1m]\",\"hypothesis_source\":\"agent\",\"note\":\"card also cites fixtures/project/execution.log (repo file, not an explicit input)\",\"timestamp\":\"$(date -u +%FT%TZ)\"}" >> $O/audit.log
cat -n $O/artifacts/reflection-card.yaml | sed -n '1,5p'
